# Room Service Module 

Custom Synapse module responsible for managing discoverable rooms, including 
- public room list (discover)
- joining rooms via keyword (invite)
- room creation (create - WIP)

## Endpoints

Discover Rooms: GET /_synapse/room_service/discover
    response: 
        {
            "rooms": [
                {
                "room_id": "!abc:localhost",
                "name": "Public Room",
                "room_kind": "group",
                "access_type": "free",
                "price": 0,
                "keyword": "buzz",
                "member_count": 12
                }
            ]
        }

Join Room (by keyword): POST /_synapse/room_service/invite
    body: 
        {
            "keyword": "buzz"
        }
    response:
        {
            "joined": true
        }

Create Room (WIP): ---

## Configuration (homeserver.yaml)

modules:
  - module: modules.room_service.module.RoomServiceModule
    config:
      admin_user_id: "@admin:localhost"
      admin_token: "YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN"
      homeserver: "http://homeserver"

## Notes

- the admin user is force-joined into discoverable rooms
- member_count reflects real joined users
- keyword is public entry key for the rooms